    "collapsible_content_fpYRki": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_UEGYPY": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I join?",
            "icon": "star",
            "row_content": "<p>To activate your membership, <strong>subscribe to at least one eligible&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"https://hiatuscrafthouse.com/collections/frontpage\"><strong>spirit</strong></a><strong>!</strong></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_ep8gWE": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do subscriptions work?",
            "icon": "star",
            "row_content": "<p>Subscribe to your spirit of choice to unlock your Lollygagger Membership. Members can access their online portal at any time to switch their subscription spirit — allowing you to try something new each quarter or stick with your favorite all year long.</p><p><em>Please note that subscription orders designated for pickup will be shipped to the address on file at the customer's expense if not picked up within 90 days of order notification.</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_nfgNek": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I swap my subscribed bottle?",
            "icon": "star",
            "row_content": "<p><a href=\"https://hiatuscrafthouse.com/apps/subscriptions\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Manage subscriptions\">Click here</a> to manage your subscription. Under \"Details\", click \"Swap Product\" to choose your next subscription bottle!</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_NxcczG": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How much does the bottle club cost?",
            "icon": "star",
            "row_content": "<p>The Bottle Club is <strong>free to join</strong> — there are no sign-up or membership fees. Simply make your quarterly (four per year) bottle purchases to keep your membership active and unlock all member perks. Members also enjoy exclusive pricing on all spirits, with discounts of up to 25%.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_WqYELh": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I get my bottles?",
            "icon": "star",
            "row_content": "<p>Bottles are available for shipping in California or local pickup. Shipping is offered at a flat rate of $25.&nbsp;</p><p><em>Please note that subscription orders designated for pickup will be shipped to the address on file at the customer's expense if not picked up within 90 days of order notification.</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_EkVUbw": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can you ship out of state?",
            "icon": "star",
            "row_content": "<p>Unfortunately, we’re not able to ship spirits out of state due to current laws and regulations. However, we always welcome out-of-state visitors to stop by the distillery for a tasting when they’re in town!</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_r9aRMC": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How much do I benefit from being a member?",
            "icon": "star",
            "row_content": "<p>You’ll enjoy plenty of perks as a member:</p><ul><li>Up to&nbsp;<strong>25% off</strong>&nbsp;bottles, merchandise, and events.</li><li>One weekly <strong>complimentary tasting flight </strong>for you and a guest.</li><li><strong>Exclusive Access</strong> to member-only events, distillery workshops, tours, and tasting panels, giving you a voice in product development.</li><li><strong>First Access</strong> to new products, including single-barrel bottlings.</li><li><strong>Earn Loyalty Points</strong> on all purchases.</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_tqJ9ea": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I earn and redeem loyalty points?",
            "icon": "star",
            "row_content": "<p>Lollygaggers earn<strong> 3 points for every $1</strong> spent with us. You can also earn extra points through friend referrals, social media engagement, and birthday bonuses. Once you’ve accumulated points, you can redeem them for discounts on future purchases, such as <strong>$5 off</strong> when you reach 500 points.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_NetkFB": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I gift a membership/subscription?",
            "icon": "star",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! To gift a membership/subscription:</p><ol><li>Choose a spirit to subscribe to and add it to your cart.<br/></li><li>During checkout, enter the&nbsp;<strong>recipient’s contact information </strong>instead of your own.<br/></li><li>Complete the purchase using <strong>your&nbsp;payment details</strong>.</li></ol><p>Once the subscription is created, the recipient will receive a confirmation email and can manage their subscription directly through their own account.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_cBqBgh": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I cancel my subscription?",
            "icon": "star",
            "row_content": "<p>We’re sad to see you go! Cancellations can be made by emailing us or by managing your subscription directly through your account.</p><p>Please note that all member benefits and loyalty points will end at the time of cancellation. We ask members to commit for one year when joining, but we understand things come up.</p><p><strong>If you cancel before your fourth subscription bottle, a $30 cancellation fee will apply.</strong></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
